    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n53699" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατά-βλημα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
			τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>overthrow</i>, in argument, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πτῶμά
				τοι τὸ κ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Democr.
				125
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>anything let down</i>: hence, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b> in ships, <i>tarpaulin</i> for keeping
			off missiles, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.1629.409
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				1631.262
			</span></i>,al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>curtain, drop-scene</i> of a theatre, in pl., <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				4.127
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				131
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>skirt, fringe</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Duris
				14J.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>outer wrapper</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Art.</u>
				33
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>payment</i>, dub. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12.354
			</span></i>.</div>
